      "role": "main",
      "description": "Asami’s Theme -  @tochigi-canopy\nPuppetmaster - Kenji Kawai on Miya Records\nAjal - @tasoko_daisuke on @liquiddropgroove\nWonderscape Numinous - @deep-step on @primary_colours_music\nTemperament - @ctafad on @melifera_records\nDirection - @ctafad on @oslated\nPomme - WAV (@wwata & @vvoiski ) on @delsinrecords\nSalvation - @iori927 & Tasoko on visionary recordings\nSearching - @wata on @kompakt\nNevilla - @hironori-takahashi on @kin-ben-label\nThe Opposite Shore - @sooishi on @sohaso\nTactile Drift - @herbalistekmusic on @ethosrecords\nSelf Replication (@brendonmoeller Remix) - @deep-step on @primary_colours_music\nTrip Eden - @susumuyokotaofficial on Skintone Records",
