    {
      "id": "2395019760",
      "title": "FOG Japan invites Yoichiro Kawakami",
      "url": "https://soundcloud.com/gilles_barberis/fog-japan-invites-yoichiro",
      "role": "guest",
      "description": "Forbidden Hawaiian Sound Service is a DJ and selector blending sounds from around the world into atmospheric sets spanning balearic,ambient,jazz,and dance music. While he was touring Europe we had the honour and the pleasure to have him recording a precious ambient set as an addendum to our pilot first FOG episode. \n\n@forbiddenhawaii\n\n\ntracklist \n\nUki Reflection - Sabi @sabi_records \nApplet W . You're me @yu_su @scottg_ailey\nGekkoh @susumuyokotaofficial\nThe Water Molecule - Asuna & Opitope @user-31962072 @user964125504 @chihei-hatakeyama\nChaparral - Total Blue @music-from-memory\nColored Air - 日向敏文 @toshifumihinata\nStrange Attractor  - 細野晴臣  @haruomihosono \nNavigations - 細野晴臣 @haruomihosono\nRising Moon - Inoue Kaoru @kaoru324\n波光 - 深草アキ @aki-fukakusa\nA Sea Of Love - Huerco S. @inciensorecs @huerco_s",
      "checked_at": "2026-09-19"
    },
