    {
      "id": "2396433579",
      "title": "FOG France invites Nawl",
      "url": "https://soundcloud.com/gilles_barberis/fog-france-invites-nawl",
      "role": "guest",
      "description": "@nawl_music\n\"Glimmer and fade\" \nThis podcast is an interpretation of the alteration of time unique to the Vallée Électrique festival. Here, hours stretch out. The mind navigates between subaqueous immersion and shared waves. Captivated by the collective energy, the listener refuses to tune out, until collapsing from exhaustion. The mind then finds peace, in the wake of the last glimmer, like a candle going out.",
      "checked_at": "2026-09-19"
    },
    {
      "id": "2374091774",
      "title": "FOG Korea invites Recy",
      "url": "https://soundcloud.com/gilles_barberis/recy-x-fog-korea",
      "role": "guest",
      "description": "Recy, based in Seoul, seamlessly weaves percussive elements with expansive, nature-inspired soundscapes. As a producer and DJ active in Korea’s underground scene, he crafts immersive experiences, translating raw, stimulating textures into a primal language for the dancefloor. With releases on highly respected labels, he continues to push the boundaries of his sonic identity.\n\n1. Material Things / Pike - Drums for Menelik [Intertoto Remix] [2024/12th Isle]\n2. @ellellellellellellellelle - Guardarsi Indietro [2019/Oslated]\n3. @mownofficial - Patience [2021/Circular Limited]\n4. @enabofficial - Liminal [2026/Secuencias Temporales]\n5. @marco_shuttle - I Fail. You Fall. [2017/Spazio Disponibile]\n6. @robert_istoc - Experience [2026/Qilla Records]\n7. @adampits - Plateau [2026/Fur:ther Sessions]\n8. dj-fix1 & earthdog_jek - Coyote Club (@humanspacemachine Remix) [2025/Earth Dog]\n9. @solarythm_deeptech_side  & @klara_vedis - Fragmentation reality [2021/Annulled Music]\n10. Dåggěr - Drift [2022/QEONE]\n11. @johnplazamusic - Azulejo [2026/Liquid Drop Groove]\n12. @batuuk & @donato-dozzy - Drift [2026/!K7 Records]\n13. @shoall - Median [2025/Animalia]\n14. @priori-ties - Sub Lux (Sansibar Remix) [2024/Kalahari Oyster Cult]\n15. @templerat - Cloud Ladder 雲梯 [2026/Buttheads]\n16. @biocym - Aeriform (w/ SHFT) [2026/space•lab]\n17. @Lyderlyderlyder - Helichrysum [2022/Jazz-o-Tech]\n18. @yingtuitive - blue [2025/Third Place]",
      "checked_at": "2026-09-19"
    }
